+#   Ascend_Power             - upward thrust strength per tick (default 0.2)
+#   Max_Speed_Y             - maximum vertical speed (default 0.45)
+#   Fuel_Consumption_Rate   - fuel consumed per tick while thrusting (default 1)
+#
+#   Sounds:                 - nested Thrust/Glide sound blocks, each Sound/Volume/Pitch
