+#                              applies them while the jetpack is worn. When absent, or Bartizan isn't
+#                              installed, the jetpack is a plain fuel/thrust chestplate with vanilla
+#                              armor-material protection only.
+#     Base_Damage_Reduction - flat damage reduction fraction
+#     Traits:                - trait name -> level, read the same way Bartizan's own wearables.yml does
